OL,3,GNEWSARestaurant hoping for second
OL,4,AMichelin star
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Michelin star restaurant has high
OL,7,Fhopes for another star - but said it
OL,8,Fwas "not something that is going to
OL,9,Fhappen overnight".
OL,11,FVraic opened in the summer of 2025,
OL,12,Fbecoming Guernsey's only
OL,13,FMichelin-starred restaurant in February
OL,14,Fthis year.
OL,16,FExecutive chef Nathan Davies said he
OL,17,Fwould like to gain a second star in the
OL,18,Fnext "five to eight years" but said it
OL,19,Fwas "not something that has ever been
OL,20,Fdone in Guernsey before".
